        "footnotes": [
          "1. See Sour Service Definition and Material Requirements in Owner's Specification GS 1.0.",
          "2. Maximum Specified Blind size shall be 10NPS. A blind and spacer shall be used for larger pipe sizes. Spectacle Blind material shall be A516 Gr.70N. For low temperature service, material shall be Charpy V-notch tested at temperatures no warmer than the minimum metal design temperature.",
          "7. Threaded connections allowed subject to compliance with Owner's Specification GS 2.9 Piping Design.",
          "10. Flanged allowed 1/2 - 1 1/2 NPS for use on Post Weld Heat Treated lines.",
          "12. PWHT required when service conditions of ISO 15156 are met except as exempted in Owner's Specification GS 2.9 Welding Appendix D. When sour service piping is exempted from PWHT, it shall be indicated on drawings provided to the piping fabricator.",
          "15. No threaded connections allowed as primary process connections.",
          "24. If using SW flanges, bore to match pipe."
